```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Flowing
    Flowing --> Full: count reaches limit<br/>on_full fires (latched)
    Full --> Draining: consumer resumes<br/>count < d%
    Draining --> Flowing: count climbs<br/>slot re-armed
    Draining --> Critical: count < e%<br/>on_low_e fires
    Critical --> Draining: producer refills
    note right of Full
        Producer callback typically sets
        stop_reading = true
    end note
    note right of Draining
        on_low_d fired · producer resumes
        stop_reading = false
    end note
```
